      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Josh Gilbert, owner of Bluegum and electrician (not just a sales person) and in due course was hands-on involved in the installation, came to do the consultation/system design and made a very positive impression.  He was obviously very knowledgeable, experienced, considerate of our needs, including being able to arrange or carry out important ancillary works such as a new reverse cycle air-con/heating system, heat pump hot water system and other minor electrical works.  I bought on expectations of superior and hands-on quality of service at all stages (as opposed to price alone) and have not been disappointed.  Josh's install team were excellent.  Prompt, considerate, cleaned up completely; great in all respects.  The office team, under Josh's wife Chantel (and co-owner) were able to answer questions, arrange the scheduling and provide efficient service.  All in all, I chose Bluegum because I believed I could detect a greater \"care factor\" that would derive from a hands-on approach from the business owners.  I thought they would be a 'cut above' the other two firms that quoted and I believe that I have got this superior level of service.  Highly recommended.",
